        {
          "layer_id": "bullet_points_text_2",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "For most short adjectives (one syllable), we add -er to the end.\nExample: tall -> taller, fast -> faster, old -> older\nSpelling Rules to Remember:\nIf the adjective ends in -e, just add -r. (Example: large -> larger, nice -> nicer)\nIf the adjective ends in consonant + vowel + consonant, double the last consonant and add -er. (Example: big -> bigger, hot -> hotter, thin -> thinner)\nLet's try a few together!",
          "font": "Open Sans",
